        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jason Pinkston, Todd Pinkston, Dick Daugherty\n- Organizations: Cleveland Browns, Los Angeles Rams, National Football League\n- Places: FirstEnergy Stadium, Berea, Ohio\n- Roles: Offensive guard, offensive lineman, linebacker\n\nFacts:\n- Dick Daugherty was born on March 31, 1929, and he was an offensive lineman and linebacker who played six NFL seasons for the Los Angeles Rams.\n- Jason R. Pinkston was born on September 5, 1987, and he is a former American football offensive guard.\n- The Cleveland Browns have played their home games at FirstEnergy Stadium since it opened in 1999.\n- The Cleveland Browns have administrative offices and training facilities in Berea, Ohio.\n- Jason Pinkston played his entire NFL career for the Cleveland Browns.\n- Todd Pinkston is the cousin of former offensive lineman Jason Pinkston.\n- Dick Daugherty died on March 10, 2009.",
